963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"连朝","author":"张镃","text":"连朝溪雨溢荷塘，流水倾银万叶香。\n不是风吹乱花侧，那知处处著鸳鸯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57258,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒步游紫极观","author":"张镃","text":"孤榜前春冰雪清，山祠閒步意无营。\n曾耽幽槩穿廊曲，犹记筠冠问客生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57259,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陆严州赴召喜成三诗 其二","author":"张镃","text":"荣辱心中总不疑，因公环召独成诗。\n秪愁相见无多话，不似寻常梦里时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57260,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陆严州赴召喜成三诗 其三","author":"张镃","text":"知己从来自有天，除书宁复待人传。\n青云直上非逾分，占上声名五十年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57261,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陆严州赴召喜成三诗 其一","author":"张镃","text":"精舍欣闻已解骖，风樯不易到江干。\n一缄试读幽人语，莫作时情贺礼看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57262,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏千叶缃梅 其二","author":"张镃","text":"忍冻拖筇月下看，烟笼繁影共汗漫。\n缃裘不是多重数，争奈清宵尔许寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57263,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏千叶缃梅 其三","author":"张镃","text":"一枝深雪绽前村，冷落犹能役梦魂。\n况有堆林春万叠，传餐甘此度朝昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57264,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏千叶缃梅 其一","author":"张镃","text":"巧留芳艳待春回，不受霜飙苦折摧。\n应对群葩羞冷淡，数花并作一花开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57265,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏千叶缃梅 其五","author":"张镃","text":"玉砌珠攒萼翠中，开时应是费东风。\n临摹不著诗人手，剪綵徒劳蠹女工。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57266,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏千叶缃梅 其四","author":"张镃","text":"光摇层蕊望晴花，谁把鹅黄染练纱。\n已是被香侵到骨，不须呼酒但烹茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57267,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏清苦","author":"张镃","text":"清苦任渠诗作祟，黑甜安尔睡为魔。\n七言赋就赏音少，一枕觉来佳兴多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57268,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐因观杨伯虎和春字韵诗偶成五绝再寄 其一","author":"张镃","text":"挑尽灯花夜未眠，清寒浑忘是春天。\n霜侵绿鬓张居士，空坐书帏三十年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57269,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐因观杨伯虎和春字韵诗偶成五绝再寄 其五","author":"张镃","text":"苕霅从来著志和，子云宁久占烟波。\n速归径上清班好，时过南湖伴浩歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57270,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐因观杨伯虎和春字韵诗偶成五绝再寄 其二","author":"张镃","text":"案上因翻简铁堆，亲朋何日和诗回。\n高怀剩得清閒力，满纸溪山秀色开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57271,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐因观杨伯虎和春字韵诗偶成五绝再寄 其三","author":"张镃","text":"往事追思重惨伤，相从常醉德勋堂。\n每登屺岵数鸿雁，老泪风前必数行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57272,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐因观杨伯虎和春字韵诗偶成五绝再寄 其四","author":"张镃","text":"宦情侬自本来无，君亦琳宫暂逸居。\n西华武夷俱绝胜，可教诗卷此时疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57273,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜闻渔歌","author":"张镃","text":"非竹非丝响裂空，高歌三唱出渔篷。\n清溪激越犹如许，想见湘波欸乃中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57274,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜赋","author":"张镃","text":"月黑林间亦自奇，莲花两朵白如衣。\n初疑野鹭池中立，试拍栏干嚇不飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57275,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孟尝君","author":"张镃","text":"狗盗鸡鸣却遇知，可怜真士不逢时。\n诗书若作空言看，凤至鸾游孰致之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57276,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绍兴间国工胡伟琵琶擅称一时其徒豪兴得胡心传之妙今年七十二清健伎益精从容话故都事使人感叹因书小诗与之","author":"张镃","text":"半生繁会想梨园，醒耳秋风凤语弦。\n我亦秦关归未暇，故都休说汴河边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57277,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"觅句","author":"张镃","text":"觅句先须莫苦心，从来瓦注胜如金。\n见成若不拈来使，箭已离弦作么寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57278,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金凤花","author":"张镃","text":"彩凤连翩小作群，萧条门巷独留春。\n莫因繁冶生轻鄙，岁岁花开见主人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57279,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中闻雁","author":"张镃","text":"小雨终朝湿翠霏，渚蒲汀树白瀰瀰。\n若嫌鸣雁无厌足，回到潮州又索诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57280,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"前后植木犀楼上有月台尽见诸山","author":"张镃","text":"盛世适亲逢，楼台得地雄。\n无形兼有象，俱在太和中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57281,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南湖上观萍","author":"张镃","text":"风掠浮萍水面来，翠绡成段接还开。\n无情却似多情物，不到诗中不肯回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57282,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南湖书事五首 其五","author":"张镃","text":"恍看滟滟紫金幢，日脚横澜万褶光。\n吹到槛边争荡激，直疑身似水仙王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57283,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南湖书事五首 其四","author":"张镃","text":"水鸟鸿俦已可听，湱然分练蹙波声。\n成群争似沙鸥少，别有高閒物外情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57284,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南湖书事五首 其三","author":"张镃","text":"科树梯斜倚暮晖，犬声如蛤透疏篱。\n谢天排出江村景，副我凭栏一望时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57285,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]